# Sefaria-Export-Archive revision the build is pinned to.
#
# One line, two fields: <commit> <commit-date>. Read by build/fetch_export.sh
# (what to check out) and build/build_all.sh (what to record in reports/ when
# the export checkout cannot report its own HEAD).
#
# Reproducing the shipped reports/ means keeping this commit. Moving it forward
# is a deliberate act: the coverage, licence and merge-fidelity reports are all
# regenerated from whatever is pinned here.
